{"id":"iiirhalw7ukcmw76cngsgqjep","title":"古岩揭示地壳深处的剧烈变迁","originalTitle":"Ancient rocks reveal a dramatic journey from deep inside Earth","summary":"伊斯坦布尔技术大学（ITU）研究人员通过结合多种矿物地质时钟，研究了土耳其马尔马拉海南部和岛屿上的花岗岩从地下深处冷却至地表的过程，发现该地区在始新世和渐新世经历了两次快速冷却阶段，分别对应不同的地质过程。研究发表在《亚洲地球科学杂志》上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-ancient-reveal-journey-deep-earth.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T19:00:14.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T19:01:57.256Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T19:01:57.256Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":49,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"05158560-e1dd-49e4-b6a3-4de32d6490d0","title":"ITU研究揭示马尔马拉地区古岩深部地球变迁"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"05158560-e1dd-49e4-b6a3-4de32d6490d0","title":"ITU研究揭示马尔马拉地区古岩深部地球变迁"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f5y6yT9BbYno","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}